{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05608","headline":"赋得游人久不归 · 贺朝","name":"赋得游人久不归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乡关眇天末，引领怅怀归。\n羇旅久淫滞，物色屡芳菲。\n稍觉出意尽，行看蓬鬓稀。\n如何千里外，伫立沾裳衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺朝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05608.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05608","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}